+// Experiment (team session 2026-11-11, Phase 1): ALFSH_BATCH=1 routes geqrf/getrf through oneMKL's strided batch API with
+// batch size 1 (a different oneMKL implementation; the plain device geqrf/getrf are documented as hybrid, part on the CPU).
